  "body": "Tucked away on a quiet cul-de-sac, this brand-new standalone home pairs timeless weatherboard and Craftstone cladding with elegant French-inspired interiors. Thoughtfully designed for modern living, it combines generous space, beautiful natural light and easy- care living in a sought-after, family-friendly Browns Bay neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nWith approximately 148.4sqm of floor area, the home features three generously sized double bedrooms, two living areas, two bathrooms and a separate guest toilet, providing plenty of room for comfortable family living.\r\n\r\nThe north-facing, open-plan living, dining and kitchen area is the heart of the home, with large floor-to-ceiling windows welcoming abundant natural light and sunshine. The contemporary kitchen stands out with its curved island, fluted detailing and sleek cabinetry, while ample storage keeps everything neatly organised. A dedicated laundry area adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a separate sitting room offers a quiet space to read, work from home or unwind. All three double bedrooms enjoy a sunny northerly aspect, with the spacious master bedroom featuring a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite.\r\n\r\nOther features:\r\n* Two Daikin heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n* Keyless smart lock entry and burglar alarm\r\n* Fully fenced, easy-care yard\r\n* Internal-access single garage plus additional off-street parking\r\n\r\nThe location adds to the appeal. Sherwood School and Northcross Intermediate are approximately a two-minute drive or a 15-minute walk away. Nearby Freyberg Park offers two playgrounds, while Browns Bay’s local shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and sandy beach are all just a five-minute drive away.\r\n\r\nWestfield Albany, the Albany Park and Ride and motorway access are also conveniently close by, making commuting and everyday errands that much easier.\r\n\r\nWhether you are raising a family or a busy professional seeking a stylish, spacious home without the upkeep of a larger property, this brand-new residence offers an appealing balance of contemporary design, everyday comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
